The freshness receipt documents seven mtime-only roots, avoiding false reuse of
shared relative dependency paths while retaining source bytes.

The lease-release receipt identifies this source commit, all four successful
bounded checks, zero source fixes, and no remaining owned Cargo/Gradle/app
